# ============================================================================
# QQ飞车录像分析器 — repository ignore policy
#
# Tracked  : Data/App/** (program source, docs, tests) + AGENTS.md + 启动前端.bat
# Untracked: all runtime, user, derived and machine-local data under Data/**
#
# Rationale: the program is source; everything under Data/ except Data/App is
# either user data (replays, labels), a derived cache, a diagnostic log, or
# machine-local configuration. None of it belongs in Git history.
# ============================================================================

# --- User data: replays and local labels ---------------------------------
# Raw .sav archives are the user's own recordings and must never be published.
/Data/ReplayArchive/
# The workspace-root replay drop folder. It holds the user's own recordings plus
# sidecar ReplayData exports: a QQSpeed file name carries the player nickname and a
# ReplayData export carries uin / nickname / race ids, so nothing here may ever be
# staged. It is enumerated as local evidence only (see Tools/AnalysisClosure).
/replay/
# Replay Catalog: the local active/removed replay set. Runtime state, not source.
/Data/ReplayCatalog/
# Display labels / manual map names are local user state, not project source.
/Data/replay_labels.json
/Data/manual_map_names.json

# --- Machine-local configuration (can contain absolute local paths) ------
/Data/settings.json

# --- Derived caches ------------------------------------------------------
# Validated caches are preserved on disk but are reproducible build output.
/Data/PhysicalTelemetryCache/
/Data/NativeActionCache/
/Data/Telemetry/
/Data/NativeMaps/
/Data/NativeIdentity/
/Data/ReplayResolution/
/Data/MapCatalog/

# --- Runtime output, logs and diagnostics --------------------------------
/Output/
/Data/Logs/
/Data/Diagnostics/
/Data/WebUpload/

# --- Retired architecture snapshot and legacy handoff (deleted 2026-09-30) ---
# The V2 retired snapshot and the old handoff document were deleted from the
# active workspace, so no agent can mistake them for current production
# authority. The patterns are kept as defensive ignores so that an accidental
# recreation can never re-enter the repository.
/Data/Legacy/
/Data/Project/PROJECT_HANDOFF.md

# --- Workspace-root scratch ----------------------------------------------
/Screenshot_*.jpg

# --- Agent / editor / OS local state ------------------------------------
.dsh-meow/
.codex/
.claude/
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Archives, patches, scratch -----------------------------------------
*.zip
*.sha256
*.patch
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
